  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lemon juice, olive oil, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add the pak choi leaves to the bowl and toss to coat with the dressing.",
    "Thread the pak choi leaves, ferment-kimchi, feta cheese, kalamata olives, artichoke hearts, and sun-dried tomatoes onto skewers.",
    "Brush the skewers with the remaining dressing.",
    "Grill the skewers for 5-7 minutes per side, or until the pak choi is tender.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley and serve immediately.",
    "Serve with a side of quinoa or brown rice for a filling meal."
  ],
